// Data sources. Both views read generated files from this repo, never the
// live Google Sheets: the sheets stay private (they hold recruiter emails and
// private notes in columns that must never be public).
// Jobs view: data/jobs.csv, regenerated by tools/build-jobs-data.py through
// the authenticated Sheets API. It carries Date, Company, Role, Channel,
// Status and Comp / Rate only; Notes are never emitted and any email address
// found in a public column is stripped by the generator.
// PRs view: data/prs.json, regenerated by tools/build-prs-data.py from the
// GitHub API, because the sheet's Status column tracks our PR's outcome, not
// the issue's own state. The generator keeps its own sheet reference.
window.TRACKER_CONFIG = {
  owner: "Rene Turcios",
  github: "CloudCorpRecords",
  jobsCsv: "",
  prsCsv: "",
  jobsSheetId: "",
  prsSheetId: "",
  refreshMinutes: 5,
};
